            "review_title": "Review at Silo Cafe",
            "review_text": "DuongVo\n2 contributions\n0\nA great find of authentic cafe and restaurant!\nOct 2018 • Couples\nFabulous cafe and clean restaurant! They roast coffee and cook all of the food such as pizza, cake, caramel ...etc by themselves ! They even imported Colombia, Zambia and East Timor green bean to roast at their cafe. Very friendly and beautiful smile staffs! Great atmosphere! Strongly recommend for everyone who have to wait at Viet Frech Hospital!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 17, 2018",
